@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Terms of Service";
}

<div class="clinic-card border-0 shadow-sm" style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
    <div class="d-flex flex-column align-items-center text-center mb-5 border-bottom pb-4">
        <div class="bg-primary bg-opacity-10 text-primary rounded-circle d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center mb-3 shadow-sm" style="width: 80px; height: 80px;">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-file-contract fa-2x"></i>
        </div>
        <h2 class="mb-2 fw-bold text-dark">Terms of Service</h2>
        <p class="text-muted mb-0">Welcome to the HU IoT Student Clinic Management System.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="text-muted" style="line-height: 1.8;">
        
        <p>By accessing or using this system, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service and all applicable laws and regulations. If you do not agree with any of these terms, you are prohibited from using or accessing this site.</p>

        <h5 class="text-dark mt-4 fw-bold">1. System Access and Usage</h5>
        <p>Access to the system is granted solely for authorized personnel of the Hawassa University IoT Clinic. You agree to use the system only for lawful purposes related to clinic management, patient care, and administrative duties.</p>

        <h5 class="text-dark mt-4 fw-bold">2. User Account Responsibilities</h5>
        <p>You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your account credentials (username and password) and for all activities that occur under your account. Any unauthorized use of your account must be immediately reported to the system administrator.</p>

        <h5 class="text-dark mt-4 fw-bold">3. Patient Confidentiality</h5>
        <p>As a user of this system, you are legally and ethically bound to maintain strict patient confidentiality. You must not disclose, share, or misuse any medical records, test results, or personal information outside the scope of your official duties.</p>

        <h5 class="text-dark mt-4 fw-bold">4. System Integrity</h5>
        <p>You agree not to engage in any activity that interferes with or disrupts the operation of the system, including attempting to gain unauthorized access to other users' accounts or restricted areas of the platform.</p>

        <h5 class="text-dark mt-4 fw-bold">5. Modifications</h5>
        <p>Hawassa University IoT reserves the right to revise these terms of service at any time without notice. By using this system, you agree to be bound by the then-current version of these Terms of Service.</p>
        
        <p class="small mt-5 pt-3 border-top">Last updated: @DateTime.Now.ToString("MMMM yyyy")</p>
    </div>
</div>
